WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.420
Speaker 1: The Trump team is raging over poll&nbsp;
numbers that increasingly show Donald Trump&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:14.100
failing in swing states where Ron Desanctis is&nbsp;
actually doing pretty well. There's a Newsweek&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:19.320
article that summarizes it. Donald Trump's&nbsp;
campaign team has dismissed the finding of a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:25.560
poll that suggests Florida Governor Ron DeSantis&nbsp;
would be the preferred 2024 candidate against Joe&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:32.160
