Pennsylvania in a hypothetical 2024 face off by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:50.700
48 to 42 and 45 to 42. Poll of 500 registered&nbsp;
voters in Arizona and Pennsylvania also showed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.700 --> 00:01:00.180
Trump would lose to Biden in the key states if&nbsp;
they faced off again in 2024. So the the Trump&nbsp;&nbsp;

