put out a tweet saying, quote, Public opinion&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:13.980
strategies. POTUS tried desperately for days to&nbsp;
try to pitch this fake poll to other outlets,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:13.980 --> 00:01:19.920
but they refused to disclose their to disclose&nbsp;
their ties to other 2024 candidates and would not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:27.300
release their crosstabs data. Truly a Post poll.&nbsp;
Now, I have to tell you the reality is this is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:32.820
not a unique result. I've been telling you for a&nbsp;
while that the polling suggests that while Trump&nbsp;&nbsp;

